    "v.help.transcriptionTips": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "💡 TIPS\nTo improve quality, try the following.\n* Use audio around 5-15 seconds long. Too short or too long gives poor results.\n* Use audio with only the person's voice (avoid BGM, noise, and other voices).\n* If the transcription looks wrong, correct it manually."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "💡 TIPS\n品質を上げるためには以下を試してみてください。\n* 5~15秒程度の音声にしてください。短過ぎても長過ぎても良い結果になりません。\n* 極力本人のみの声（BGM・ノイズ・他人の声が入らないようにする）にしてください。\n* 文字起こしの結果がおかしい場合は手動で修正してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "consent.title": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage Notes and Consent"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ご利用上の注意・同意事項"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "consent.body": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This application is a tool for speech transcription and speech synthesis.\n\nWhen using audio, text, generated content, and related materials handled by this application, please investigate and confirm relevant laws, third-party rights, terms of use, and so on yourself, and use the application appropriately.\n\nThe provider of this application does not verify or guarantee the legality of each user's input, generation, storage, or other use, whether rights clearance is required, or whether third-party consent has been obtained.\n\nThe provider does not investigate, judge, provide legal consultation, advice, or other individual support regarding specific situations or specific ways of using this application. If you have questions or uncertainties, please confirm relevant laws, terms of use, official materials, and so on yourself, and consult a lawyer or other professional as necessary.\n\nIf problems arise with third parties in connection with the use of this application, you will handle them under your own responsibility.\n\nWith your understanding of the above, please use this application at your own judgment and responsibility."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本アプリは、音声の文字起こしおよび音声合成を行うツールです。\n\n本アプリで取り扱う音声・テキスト・生成物等の利用にあたっては、関連する法令、第三者の権利、利用条件等をご自身で調査・確認し、適切にご利用ください。\n\n本アプリの提供者は、個々の利用者による入力、生成、保存その他の利用行為について、その適法性、権利処理の要否、第三者の許諾の有無等を確認または保証するものではありません。\n\n本アプリの利用に関する個別の状況や具体的な利用方法について、提供者は調査、判断、法律相談、助言、その他の個別対応を行いません。疑問や不明点がある場合は、利用者ご自身で関係法令、利用規約、公式資料等を確認し、必要に応じて弁護士その他の専門家へご相談ください。\n\n本アプリの利用に伴い、第三者との間で問題が生じた場合は、利用者ご自身の責任において対応するものとします。\n\n上記をご理解のうえ、ご自身の判断と責任において本アプリをご利用ください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "consent.check": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have reviewed the above, and I agree to use this application at my own judgment and responsibility, after investigating and confirming specific usage and legal judgments myself."
